    "name": {
      "value": "Staff Of Healing"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "crb"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Made of smooth, white wood, this staff is capped at each end with a golden cross adorned with a multitude of ruby cabochons. A staff of healing grants an item bonus to the Hit Points you restore anytime you cast the heal spell using your own spell slots or using charges from the staff.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\nThe item bonus granted to heal spells is +1.\n\n- **Cantrip** stabilize\n- **1st** heal"
    },
